actly-right-to-warn-enterprises-against-feeding-data-to-openai-and-anthropic-the-figma-story-shows-why"}'::jsonb, '142b9414be3f7aaad9de7df59c03d1e9b6447e19a57828dd07770418619e149d', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000060.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/60268293/e66b52b691ce.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:35.933866+00:00'::timestamptz
