ng>Microsoft Corporation</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"MSFT\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MSFT\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MSFT\\">MSFT</a>)</a>, <strong>Amazon.com, Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AMZN\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\">AMZN</a>)</a> and <strong>Alphabet Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOGL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\">GOOGL</a>)</a> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a> continue backing their multibillion-dollar AI ambitions with sustained spending on the optical networking hardware that companies like Applied Optoelectronics supply. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>If those investments remain intact, Thursday&#8217;s sell-off could be remembered less as the start of a downturn and more as a reality check for one of the market&#8217;s hottest AI trades.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/esg/26/07/60227061/enphase-energy-enph-investors-valuing-wrong-ai\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nEXCLUSIVE: Enphase Says Investors Are Valuing It Wrong—and AI Could Change That</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image via Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-07-03T15:31:08Z", "headline": "This AI Stock Beat Nvidia by 200%—Then Zuckerberg Sparked a 17% Sell-Off", "id": 60266223, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/07/03/Ai-And-Data-Analysis-For-Financial-Repor.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/07/03/Ai-And-Data-Analysis-For-Financial-Repor.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/07/03/Ai-And-Data-Analysis-For-Financial-Repor.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Applied Optoelectronics (AAOI) tumbled 17% after Zuckerberg&#39;s AI comments, yet the AI networking stock still outpaces Nvidia by more than 200% this year.", "symbols": ["AAOI", "AMZN", "COHR", "GOOG", "GOOGL", "LITE", "META", "MSFT", "NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:31:08Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/07/60266223/this-ai-stock-beat-nvidia-by-200-then-zuckerberg-sparked-a-17-sell-off"}'::jsonb, 'fb7b9de1c7b2ed71984ac4e46bfc38ad4349a44490473a1ebf400b6f79f29e27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000060.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/60266223/e3de28a3e2f8.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:35.918624+00:00'::timestamptz
