ear,\\" Woods tells Benzinga in an exclusive interview.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>With the S&amp;P 500 trading near 7,500 at the time of the interview, Woods said it’s hard to know if the market index has peaked for 2026.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Based on seasonality, historical patterns and market rotation, Woods lays out his best guess of what happens for the second half of 2026.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"I can see a drawdown of 10% from our peak, which would give us a trip back below 7,000 in the coming three to four months and then we rally after this election is over. That’s how the cycle plays out.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Woods predicts that the S&amp;P 500, which is tracked by the<strong> SPDR S&amp;P 500 ETF Trust </strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPY\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SPY\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPY\\">SPY</a>)</a> cold close the year out at the 7,650 or 7,700 level.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"I still think if we finish this year at 7,200, at 7,300, it’s a successful year.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/06/60169179/sp-500-might-finish-june-in-the-red-july-could-bring-a-much%E2%80%91needed-lift\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nS&amp;P 500 Might Finish June In The Red: July Could Bring A Much Needed Lift</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Micron the New Market ‘Tell’</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>One of the keys to where the S&amp;P 500 trades in the second half is earnings reports before the end of the year.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"Do we reward companies for good earnings or do we keep them where they are?\\" Woods said. \\"I think Micron is now the new tell. It’s been Nvidia forever. It was Apple for years. There was Microsoft for years.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Woods thinks Micron is now the best representative to the market based on its extreme growth and how investors react to earnings reports.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"Their earnings are growing hand over fist. You cannot put enough superlatives on what they’re doing, but price action’s starting to slow.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Micron <a href=\\"http://benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/06/60085248/micron-delivers-another-blowout-quarter-raises-guidance-on-rapidly-growing-demand\\">reported third-quarter financial earnings </a>in late June, with fourth-quarter results expected to be reported in September.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The market expert cautions that when price action slows, there might be a correction. Woods cites past data from <strong>NVIDIA Corp</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> and similar patterns in his weekly <a href=\\"https://www.freedomcapmkts.com/newsletter\\">newsletter</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Woods recalls Nvidia stock being on an unstoppable run until the third quarter of 2023, when price action did not respond to the company’s biggest blowout quarter ever.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"The momentum was lost. And when I look at momentum indicators in Micron, I see a divergence. It’s a bearish divergence.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Micron is a great long-term stock according to Woods, who predicts the company could have a future market capitalization of $2.5 trillion or more.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Woods cautions that the stock is likely to consolidate from here and it could take some time to \\"take that next leg higher.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"Micron will be the one to watch.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/06/52944066/exclusive-top-12-most-searched-tickers-in-may-on-benzinga-pro-micron-sandisk-qualcomm-surge-up-leaderboard\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nEXCLUSIVE: Top 12 Most-Searched Tickers in June on Benzinga Pro — SpaceX, Marvell Join List, Micron Stays On Top</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo Courtesy: Piotr Swat on Shutterstock.com</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-07-02T18:39:51Z", "headline": "EXCLUSIVE: Market Expert Jay Woods Says Micron Stock is New Market ‘Tell,’ Following Footsteps of Nvidia, Apple, Microsoft", "id": 60256473, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/07/02/Konskie--Poland---November-21--2024-Micr.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/07/02/Konskie--Poland---November-21--2024-Micr.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/07/02/Konskie--Poland---November-21--2024-Micr.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Market expert Jay Woods makes his predictions for the S&amp;P 500 in the second half of 2026 and tells Benzinga Micron is now the stock to watch.", "symbols": ["MU", "NVDA", "SPY"], "updated_at": "2026-07-02T18:39:51Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/07/60256473/exclusive-market-expert-jay-woods-says-micron-stock-is-new-market-tell-following-footsteps-of-nvidia-apple-microsoft"}'::jsonb, '25058b8a356ee5a09c5c4a4c5f8c352e2123467c59880f35709071f1c6e1d71f', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000060.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/60256473/fc0a2fc1c45e.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:35.869778+00:00'::timestamptz
