s of 1,000% or more are made, it’s harder for a stock to keep growing at the same exponential pace.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/05/52890229/microns-spectacular-rally-may-not-have-happened-if-not-for-mcdonalds-potato-supplier\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nMicron&#039;s Spectacular Rally May Not Have Happened If Not For McDonald&#039;s Potato Supplier</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image via Shutterstock</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-17T19:53:15Z", "headline": "Nvidia Is the Best S&P 500 Stock of the Past 10, 15, 20 Years — but 4 Stocks Beat It Over the Past 5 Years", "id": 61259954, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Shanghai-china-march-15th-2026-Nvidia-Br.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Shanghai-china-march-15th-2026-Nvidia-Br.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Shanghai-china-march-15th-2026-Nvidia-Br.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Nvidia stock is the top stock gainer over the last 10, 15 and 20 years. Here&#39;s who beats the stock in five-year gains.", "symbols": ["AAPL", "AMAT", "AMD", "AMZN", "ANET", "AVGO", "AXON", "CIEN", "EME", "FIX", "FTNT", "KLAC", "LITE", "LRCX", "MPWR", "MU", "NFLX", "NVDA", "PWR", "STX", "TPL", "TSLA", "URI"], "updated_at": "2026-08-17T19:53:15Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/08/61259954/nvidia-is-the-best-sp-500-stock-of-the-past-10-15-20-years-but-4-stocks-beat-it-over-the-past-5-years"}'::jsonb, '2afbe2a04bf0a08969368267701b23b0f1fbf32edeb0fe2b7334100f8e115436', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learni