KK\\" data-exchange=\\"BATS\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKK\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(BATS:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKK\\">ARKK</a>)</a>, <strong>ARK Autonomous Technology &amp; Robotics ETF</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"ARKQ\\" data-exchange=\\"BATS\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKQ\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(BATS:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKQ\\">ARKQ</a>)</a>, <strong>ARK Next Generation Internet ETF</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"ARKW\\" data-exchange=\\"BATS\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKW\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(BATS:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKW\\">ARKW</a>)</a>, and <strong>ARK Space &amp; Defense Innovation ETF</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"ARKX\\" data-exchange=\\"BATS\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(BATS:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARKX\\">ARKX</a>)</a>. NVIDIA&#8217;s stock closed at $225.01, and Ark&#8217;s acquisition of 101,356 shares in ARKK alone translates to an investment of approximately $22.8 million. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61249540/nvidias-ohio-ai-megadeal-openai-8-gw-of-compute-and-a-1-5-billion-sb-energy-bet\\">expanded its AI infrastructure strategy</a> by securing 4.25 gigawatts of data-center capacity in Ohio for OpenAI, with the site potentially supporting about $150 billion-$200 billion in Nvidia revenue per system generation. Separately, the companies were reportedly restructuring financing to reduce Nvidia&#8217;s potential guarantee from $250 billion to less than $120 billion, while OpenAI’s broader commitments could represent roughly $600 billion in the <strong>Jensen Huang</strong>-led company&#8217;s computing systems through 2030.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61264177/google-spirit-airlines-10-million-data-ai-training\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nGoogle is Paying $10 Million for Bankrupt Spirit Airlines&#039; Old Emails and Spreadsheets: Here&#039;s Why</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">The AMD Trade</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Ark sold shares of Advanced Micro Devices across <strong>ARKF</strong>, <strong>ARKQ</strong>, <strong>ARKX</strong> and <strong>ARKW</strong>. AMD&#8217;s stock closed at $506.00, and Ark&#8217;s sale of 25,917 shares amounted to approximately $13.1 million. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>AMD is currently raising up to $5 billion through a <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/offerings/26/08/61186347/amd-prepares-record-5b-bond-sale-to-fuel-massive-ai-expansion\\">bond sale to boost its AI-related investments</a>. This move is part of AMD&#8217;s broader strategy to enhance its AI computing capabilities and manage debt maturities. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">The Palantir Trade</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Ark Invest reduced its holdings in Palantir Technologies by selling shares in <strong>ARKF</strong>. Palantir&#8217;s stock closed at $172.55, and the sale of 22,023 shares equated to approximately $3.8 million. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Palantir has taken a unique approach by <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/08/60912273/palantir-growing-like-nvidia-without-ai-models\\">developing software</a> that integrates with various AI models rather than building its own. This strategy allows Palantir to benefit from the AI boom without heavy investments in AI infrastructure. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Other Key Trades</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li>ARKF bought 5,001 shares of <strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong> (NET).</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>ARKG sold 42,028 shares of <strong>Twist Bioscience Corporation</strong> (TWST).</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>ARKK sold 592,227 shares of <strong>Roblox Corp</strong>. (RBLX).</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>ARKG sold 226,381 shares of <strong>AtaiBeckley Inc</strong>. (ATAI).</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>ARKK bought 344,578 shares of <strong>Cerus Corp</strong>. (CERS).</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>ARKG purchased 22,666 shares of Tempus AI Inc. (TEM).</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Benzinga Edge Stock Rankings</strong> indicate Nvidia stock has a Momentum score in the 68th percentile and Value score in the 6th percentile.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-full\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"446\\" height=\\"279\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17222640/Screenshot-2026-08-18-at-11.26.32.png\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-1606089\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17222640/Screenshot-2026-08-18-at-11.26.32.png 446w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17222640/Screenshot-2026-08-18-at-11.26.32-300x188.png 300w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 446px) 100vw, 446px\\" /></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61264084/nike-meta-platforms-invo-fertility-eyepoint-pharmaceuticals-and-micron-why-these-5-stocks-are-on-investors-radars-today\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNike, Meta Platforms, INVO Fertility, EyePoint Pharmaceuticals, and Micron: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors&#039; Radars Today</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo Courtesy: ChrisStock82 on Shutterstock.com</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer:</em></strong><em> This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors.</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-18T02:37:31Z", "headline": "Cathie Wood Buys $22.8 Million of Nvidia Stock, Ark Invest Dumps AMD and Palantir Shares", "id": 61264305, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/18/Germany--Mannheim-January-29--2025--Sign.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/18/Germany--Mannheim-January-29--2025--Sign.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/18/Germany--Mannheim-January-29--2025--Sign.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Ark Invest bought $22.8 million of Nvidia while dumping AMD and Palantir shares on Monday, Aug. 17, 2026.", "symbols": ["AMD", "ARKF", "ARKK", "ARKQ", "ARKW", "ARKX", "NVDA", "PLTR"], "updated_at": "2026-08-18T02:37:31Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/news/26/08/61264305/cathie-wood-buys-22-8-million-of-nvidia-stock-ark-invest-dumps-amd-and-palantir-shares"}'::jsonb, 'ac749b996cfa0a5524691fde8d9c6194c8a37076fc5a9e146d70959e280fcc69', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61264305/3b2ca557c0c5.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.080751+00:00'::timestamptz
