SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61239930' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = 'c7c12e9acb24cd997c806539b41a92e948fd5d9aa4d5790b433df5a0810ac196' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Aniket Verma", "content": "<p>Harvard University left its <strong>Bitcoin </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"BTC\\" data-exchange=\\"CRYPTO\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/BTC-USD\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(CRYPTO: BTC)</a> exchange-traded fund (ETF) position unchanged in the second quarter, according to its latest 13F filing released Friday.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Harvard Holds Bitcoin ETF Position Steady</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Harvard Management Co.</strong>, a wholly owned subsidiary of Harvard University that manages its financial assets, reported holding 3.04 million shares of the <strong>iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"IBIT\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/IBIT\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/IBIT\\">IBIT</a>)</a> as of June 30. The stake was worth $101.35 million based on IBIT&#8217;s price of 33.29 on June 30.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Harvard slashed its Bitcoin ETF stake significantly in the first quarter</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>What was previously <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/crypto/cryptocurrency/26/02/50640507/harvard-university-cuts-bitcoin-etf-holdings-in-q4-enters-ethereum-etf-for-first-time-crypto-billionaire-changpeng-zhao-wonders-whats-next\\">Harvard’s top position</a>, IBIT has slipped to eleventh place and currently represents 2.38% of the portfolio. Harvard bought the ETF first during the second quarter of 2025.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Meanwhile, Harvard bought no new stake in the spot <strong>Ethereum </strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ETH-USD\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"ETH\\" data-exchange=\\"CRYPTO\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(CRYPTO: ETH)</a> ETF after liquidating the position entirely in the first quarter.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/crypto/cryptocurrency/26/08/61237092/mark-cuban-bitcoin-gold-bill-maher-shark-tank-btc\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nMark Cuban Once Told Bill Maher He’d Be ‘Dumb’ to Choose Gold Over Bitcoin — Less Than Four Years Later, the &#039;Shark Tank&#039; Star Has Dumped Most of His BTC</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Harvard&#8217;s Hottest New Pick: SpaceX</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Harvard also <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61238060/harvard-2-2-billion-spacex-stake-elon-musk-largest-equity\\">disclosed a $2.2 billion stake</a> in&nbsp;<strong>Space Exploration Technologies Corp.&nbsp;</strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SPCX\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\">SPCX</a>)</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The stake makes SpaceX Harvard’s largest holding, well ahead of its next-largest positions in&nbsp;<strong>Amazon.com, Inc.</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AMZN\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\">AMZN</a>)</a>,&nbsp;<strong>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co Ltd.</strong>&nbsp;<a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"TSM\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSM\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSM\\">TSM</a>)</a>,&nbsp;<strong>Cerebras Systems Inc&nbsp;</strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CBRS\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"CBRS\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CBRS\\">CBRS</a>)</a> and&nbsp;<strong>Nvidia Corp.</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Price Action</strong>: At the time of writing, BTC was exchanging hands at $63,355.81, up 0.57% in the last 24 hours, according to data from Benzinga Pro.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/crypto/cryptocurrency/26/08/61238339/ross-gerber-bitcoin-everyday-use-tesla-investor-michael-saylor\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nRoss Gerber Questions Bitcoin&#039;s Everyday Use Despite &#039;Endless Promise&#039; Of Its Utility: Tesla Investor Says Haven&#039;t Sold Any BTC Unlike Michael Saylor</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo courtesy: Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-17T09:33:22Z", "headline": "Harvard Did Not Sell Its Bitcoin ETF Holdings in Q2, Discloses No New Ethereum ETF Stake", "id": 61239930, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Golden-Bitcoin-Coin-Is-In-Red-And-Blue-S.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Golden-Bitcoin-Coin-Is-In-Red-And-Blue-S.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Golden-Bitcoin-Coin-Is-In-Red-And-Blue-S.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Harvard University left its Bitcoin exchange-traded fund position unchanged in the second quarter, according to its latest 13F filing.", "symbols": ["AMZN", "BTCUSD", "CBRS", "ETHUSD", "IBIT", "NVDA", "SPCX", "TSM", "ZECUSD"], "updated_at": "2026-08-17T09:33:22Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/crypto/cryptocurrency/26/08/61239930/harvard-university-did-not-sell-its-bitcoin-etf-holdings-in-q2-discloses-no-new-ethereum-etf-stake"}'::jsonb, 'b97c1d49beaa217d6a5e9cd2971d2c75670da1c3350c822ea8c4272a75b1e81a', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61239930/c7c12e9acb24.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:35.962153+00:00'::timestamptz
