SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61253659' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = '394bb13d8bd53ab2f22f2555c1a47cbbc59396aaa63f28a9d98eddd108f6d60b' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Erica Kollmann", "content": "<p><strong>Space Exploration Technologies Corp.</strong>&#8216;s <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SPCX\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\">SPCX</a>)</a> Nasdaq debut turned<strong> Elon Musk</strong>&#8216;s rocket company into one of the most widely disclosed names in the current round of 13F filings, with tech giants, hedge funds and university endowments <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61044958/spacex-stock-meltdown-takes-28-billion-bite-out-of-googles-portfolio\\">all revealing sizable positions. </a></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>SPCX stock is climbing. <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\">See the real-time price action here. </a></strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Alphabet Inc.</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOGL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\">GOOGL</a>)</a> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a> disclosed a massive position of roughly 551 million SpaceX shares worth about $94 billion in its<a href=\\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652044/000165204426000073/0001652044-26-000073-index.htm\\"> 13F-HR </a>&nbsp;filed Aug. 7.&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The stake that traces back to a <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61044958/spacex-stock-meltdown-takes-28-billion-bite-out-of-googles-portfolio\\">$900 million investment</a> in 2015 and now dwarfs the rest of Google&#8217;s disclosed public equity portfolio. Roughly $80 billion of that position remains under short-term lockup, with another $14.1 billion restricted through the third quarter of 2027.&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>NVIDIA Corp.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> <a href=\\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/0001045810-26-000065-index.html\\">disclosed</a> about 122.76 million SpaceX shares valued near $21 billion, a position that reportedly stems from Nvidia&#8217;s earlier investment in <strong>xAI</strong>. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Advanced Micro Devices </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AMD\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMD\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMD\\">AMD</a>)</a> also entered the SpaceX cap table, disclosing a $565.5 million stake in its<a href=\\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2488/000119312526352454/0001193125-26-352454-index.htm\\"> 13F-HR filed August 14</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61245245/viking-global-bets-big-on-spacex-while-ditching-coreweave-alphabet-in-q2\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nViking Global Bets Big On SpaceX While Ditching CoreWeave, Alphabet in Q2</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p>On the institutional side, <strong>Harvard Management Co.</strong> revealed a $2.2 billion SpaceX position, its single largest <a href=\\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1082621/000119312526352412/0001193125-26-352412-index.htm\\">disclosed</a> equity holding.&nbsp; <strong>Citadel Advisors</strong> also disclosed a new SpaceX position in its<a href=\\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1423053/0001104659-26-097200-index.html\\"> 13F-HR</a>, alongside new stakes in Cerebras Systems <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CBRS\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"CBRS\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CBRS\\">CBRS</a>)</a> and Quantinuum, as its overall equity portfolio ballooned 41.5% to $875.1 billion, per<a href=\\"https://cryptobriefing.com/citadel-advisors-q2-spacex-cerebras-quantinuum-stakes/\\"> CryptoBriefing</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The most concentrated bet belongs to <strong>Atreides Management.</strong> The tech-focused hedge fund&#8217;s<a href=\\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1777813/000177781326000009/0001777813-26-000009-index.html\\"> 13F-HR </a>shows SpaceX making up roughly 42% of its portfolio, a position valued at $4.67 billion at quarter-end. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The filings also reveal a long tail of other reported holders. <strong>Fidelity Investments</strong> disclosed 302.6 million shares, <strong>Gigafund Management</strong> 171.8 million, <strong>Baillie Gifford</strong> 51.4 million and <strong>BlackRock</strong> about 51 million shares.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Saudi Arabia&#8217;s Public Investment Fund</strong> reported a 154.1-million-share stake worth roughly $26.3 billion, and even <strong>Ontario Teachers&#8217; Pension Plan </strong>turned up on the SpaceX cap table, per Chaincatcher&#8217;s <a href=\\"https://www.chaincatcher.com/en/article/2283116\\">tally</a> of roughly 1,697 reporting entities disclosing SpaceX positions.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Because 13F filings only capture positions as of quarter-end and are disclosed up to 45 days later, none of these snapshots reflect any buying or selling activity since June 30 — meaning the current ownership picture, particularly given SpaceX&#8217;s price swings since its debut, may already look different.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61149767/coreweave-is-a-short-martin-shkreli-lays-out-his-bear-case\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nCoreWeave Is a &#039;Short&#039; — Martin Shkreli Lays Out His Bear Case</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>SPCX Stock Price Activity: </strong>SpaceX stock was up 6.49% at $149.08 at the time of publication Monday, according to <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\">Benzinga Pro</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo: Shutterstock</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-17T16:12:24Z", "headline": "SpaceX Stock Is Everywhere: Google, Nvidia, AMD, Harvard Disclose Stakes", "id": 61253659, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Paris--France---February-3--2026-The-Spa.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Paris--France---February-3--2026-The-Spa.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Paris--France---February-3--2026-The-Spa.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "SpaceX is one of the most disclosed names in Q2 13F filings, with tech giants, hedge funds, and universities reporting large positions.", "symbols": ["AMD", "CBRS", "GOOG", "GOOGL", "NVDA", "SPCX"], "updated_at": "2026-08-17T16:12:24Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61253659/spacex-stock-is-everywhere-google-nvidia-amd-harvard-disclose-stakes"}'::jsonb, '7f92443ab5e22b59ecee2919e110999d6ceb075ab892ce8ba36e547dca2ac44c', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61253659/394bb13d8bd5.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.035975+00:00'::timestamptz
