rket-top signal. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"It is said no one ‘rings a bell’ at risk market tops,\\" he wrote, \\"but there are declarations of ‘new asset classes’ involving ‘financial innovation’ abetted by ‘questionable ratings.’\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image: Shutterstock</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/08/61275607/meta-ai-spending-steve-eisman\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nMeta’s AI Spending Math Is &#039;Astonishing,&#039; Steve Eisman Says: Why Are Expenses Up 55%?</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>", "created_at": "2026-08-18T18:27:36Z", "headline": "''Bond King'' Jeff Gundlach Compares Nvidia''s $500 Billion AI Financing Push to Bonds Backed by Bananas: ''Will Not Age Well''", "id": 61284206, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/18/Market-Rebounds-After-Strong-NVDA-Earnin.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/18/Market-Rebounds-After-Strong-NVDA-Earnin.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/18/Market-Rebounds-After-Strong-NVDA-Earnin.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Jeff Gundlach warns Nvidia’s $500 billion AI financing push may not age well as Wall Street takes on more debt to fund the AI boom.", "symbols": ["NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-18T18:27:36Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/08/61284206/nvidia-ai-financing-gundlach-500-billion"}'::jsonb, '478482384498fccd838716bf2adb996303a81c59d3e066e12af6be3900751047', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "ra