ata-ticker=\\"KLAC\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/KLAC\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/KLAC\\">KLAC</a>)</a> and <strong>Lam Research Corporation</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"LRCX\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/LRCX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/LRCX\\">LRCX</a>)</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">New Additions:</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>Warner Bros. Discovery, Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"WBD\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/WBD\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/WBD\\">WBD</a>)</a>: 20,000,000 shares</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Riot Platforms, Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"RIOT\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/RIOT\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/RIOT\\">RIOT</a>)</a>: 3,500,000 shares </li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Block, Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"XYZ\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/XYZ\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/XYZ\\">XYZ</a>)</a>: 2,558,943 shares</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Flex Ltd.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"FLEX\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/FLEX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/FLEX\\">FLEX</a>)</a>: 1,030,000 shares</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Performance Food Group </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"PFGC\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/PFGC\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/PFGC\\">PFGC</a>)</a>: 675,000 shares</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Keysight Technologies</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"KEYS\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/KEYS\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/KEYS\\">KEYS</a>)</a>: 585,000 shares</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Sysco Corporation </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SYY\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SYY\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SYY\\">SYY</a>)</a>: 580,000 </li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Notable Raised Stakes: Q2 vs Q1</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>Alphabet Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a>: Raised from 175,000 shares in the first quarter (Q1) 2026 to 1,025,000 shares by the end of second quarter (Q2) 2026.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Norfolk Southern</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NSC\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NSC\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NSC\\">NSC</a>)</a>: Increased from 100,000 in Q1 to 600,000 shares in Q2.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Capital One Financial</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"COF\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/COF\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/COF\\">COF</a>)</a>: Boosted from 140,000 in Q1 to 825,000 shares in Q2.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>ASML Holding </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"ASML\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ASML\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ASML\\">ASML</a>)</a>: Raised from 12,000 in Q1 to 30,000 shares in Q2.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"TSM\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSM\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSM\\">TSM</a>)</a>: Increased from 275,000 in Q1 to 460,000 shares in Q2.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Hut 8 Corp.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"HUT\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/HUT\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/HUT\\">HUT</a>)</a>: Boosted from 869,563 in Q1 to 1,315,000 shares in Q2.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Meanwhile, the company trimmed stake in <strong>Amazon.com, Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AMZN\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\">AMZN</a>)</a> from 1,940,000 in Q1 to 1,750,000 shares in Q2 and <strong>Carpenter Technology</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"CRS\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CRS\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CRS\\">CRS</a>)</a> from 310,000 in Q1 to 215,000 shares in Q2.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo: MMD Creative on Shutterstock.com</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-17T16:41:26Z", "headline": "Dan Loeb Exits Nvidia, Meta And Broadcom — Bets Big On Warner Bros. Discovery", "id": 61254722, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Businessmen-Investor-Stock-Market-Value-.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Businessmen-Investor-Stock-Market-Value-.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Businessmen-Investor-Stock-Market-Value-.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "The investor exited Meta, Nvidia, Broadcom, KLA and Lam Research while adding major positions in Warner Bros. Discovery, Riot Platforms and Block.", "symbols": ["AMZN", "ASML", "AVGO", "COF", "CRS", "FLEX", "GOOG", "HUT", "KEYS", "KLAC", "LRCX", "META", "NSC", "NVDA", "PFGC", "RIOT", "SN", "SYY", "TSM", "WBD", "XYZ"], "updated_at": "2026-08-17T16:41:26Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/analyst-stock-ratings/analyst-color/26/08/61254722/dan-loeb-exits-nvidia-meta-and-broadcom-bets-big-on-warner-bros-discovery"}'::jsonb, '5baf6ac24bc954e5f307fbebb2dda7e20fd14d1fd8176c7acc95c5cfdeb40383', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61254722/c9d323bbc437.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.045006+00:00'::timestamptz
