SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61233673' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = 'af68990ef0667067d09c716639b85a03abd0b469672f98acf56c585c49c9f5a1' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Mohd Haider", "content": "<p><em>Editor&#8217;s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Ivan Feinseth.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Anthropic </strong>reportedly expects $190 billion to $200 billion in revenue by 2028, far exceeding the $47 billion annualized revenue run rate reported in May.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Bankers Reach Past Typical Timelines</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Bankers are applying enterprise value-to-revenue multiples based on forecasts, Reuters reported on Friday, citing four sources.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Anthropic’s <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/analyst-stock-ratings/reiteration/26/03/51078466/anthropics-ai-boom-could-mean-big-money-for-amazons-aws-analyst\\">revenue run rate was about $9 billion at the end of 2025</a>, then climbed to <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/06/60147915/chatgpt-towers-over-claude-with-900-million-users-but-anthropic-may-be-winning-the-ai-revenue-race-idc-estimates\\">more than $47 billion by May</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>For the second quarter of 2026, <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/05/52751133/anthropic-hits-900-billion-valuation-with-one-surprising-back%E2%80%91door-access-point-before-its-ipo\\">Anthropic expects revenue of at least $10.9 billion</a>, more than double the previous quarter.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>That would put the company on track to post its first quarterly operating profit, estimated at $559 million. Anthropic also said its revenue run rate increased more than tenfold annually in each of the three years through early 2026.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Anthropic did not immediately respond to <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\">Benzinga</a>‘s request for comment.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/private-markets/26/08/61219148/openai-anthropic-cheaper-than-chinese-ai\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nOpenAI and Anthropic May Be Cheaper Than Chinese AI After All</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Palantir, Cloudflare Set the Benchmark</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>According to the report, <strong>Palantir Technologies, Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"PLTR\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/PLTR\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/PLTR\\">PLTR</a>)</a>, <strong>Cloudflare Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NET\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NET\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NET\\">NET</a>)</a> and <strong>Space Exploration Technologies Corp </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SPCX\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\">SPCX</a>)</a> have become reference points for Anthropic&#8217;s valuation ahead of the company&#8217;s analyst day.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Palantir is trading at 53 times expected 2026 revenue, while Cloudflare trades at 41.6 times, according to LSEG data cited by Reuters. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Each company offers a different point of comparison.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Palantir reflects fast-growing businesses with exposure to AI. Cloudflare represents high-growth infrastructure companies. SpaceX represents a company valued more on its future growth potential than on its current earnings.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Skeptics Question</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Not everyone is convinced the math holds. &#8220;Could they get a $2 trillion valuation, yeah they could, and I just wonder if it would stay there over time,&#8221; David Merkel, a principal at <strong>Aleph Investments</strong>, told the publication.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>He questioned whether AI truly &#8220;produces so much additional productivity&#8221; to justify the price.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Other investors, however, remain confident in the company&#8217;s prospects. <strong>Ivan Feinseth</strong>, chief investment officer at <strong>Tigress Financial Partners</strong>, told Benzinga that he is &#8220;very positive&#8221; about Anthropic&#8217;s underlying growth and long-term potential.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Feinseth pointed to the company&#8217;s rapid revenue growth, from $9 billion in late 2025 to $47 billion by mid-May, as evidence of genuine demand rather than speculative hype. He also cited Anthropic&#8217;s relationships with <strong>Alphabet Inc.&#8217;s</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOGL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\">GOOGL</a>)</a> <strong>Google</strong>, <strong>Microsoft Corp.</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MSFT\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"MSFT\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MSFT\\">MSFT</a>)</a>, <strong>Nvidia Corp.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> and <strong>Broadcom Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AVGO\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AVGO\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AVGO\\">AVGO</a>)</a> as strategic advantages.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>At the same time, he identified several key risks, including uncertainty in forecasts, high capital requirements, dilution and growing competition from rivals.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer:</em></strong><em> This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image via Shutterstock</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/05/52751133/anthropic-hits-900-billion-valuation-with-one-surprising-back%E2%80%91door-access-point-before-its-ipo\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nBill Ackman Exits Alphabet, Raises Bets on Microsoft &amp; Meta</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>", "created_at": "2026-08-15T02:57:15Z", "headline": "Anthropic’s Revenue Could Soar From $47 Billion to $200 Billion by 2028 as Bankers Build a Massive AI Valuation Case Ahead of Its IPO: Report (UPDATED)", "id": 61233673, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/19/Guilherand-granges--France---March-06--2.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/19/Guilherand-granges--France---March-06--2.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/19/Guilherand-granges--France---March-06--2.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Anthropic is reportedly projecting up to $200 billion in 2028 revenue as bankers weigh a potential $2 trillion IPO valuation.", "symbols": ["AVGO", "GOOG", "GOOGL", "MSFT", "NET", "NVDA", "PLTR", "SPCX"], "updated_at": "2026-08-19T03:13:00Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61233673/anthropic-200-billion-2028-revenue-2-trillion-valuation"}'::jsonb, '0c09832dd6797f1911e386dc6bc099ccd2c63d0ea1cf3ca5ad1dcc876c675c7c', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61233673/af68990ef066.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:35.945197+00:00'::timestamptz
