SELECT d.document_id, (SELECT publisher_id FROM publisher WHERE canonical_key = 'benzinga'), 'media_report', 'HIVE Stock Jumps After AI Cloud Deal - Here''s Why', false, 'Akanksha Bakshi', 'HIVE AI Cloud Deal worth $350 million adds roughly $70 million in annualized revenue as shares jump in Monday premarket trading.', 'HIVE Digital Technologies Ltd. (NASDAQ:HIVE) shares rose about 8% in Monday premarket trading after the company announced a five-year GPU cloud services agreement worth approximately $350 million.

## BUZZ HPC Adds $70 Million in Annualized Revenue

The five-year agreement with an investment-grade enterprise customer is expected to add roughly $70 million in annualized revenue, lifting BUZZ HPC’s total annualized revenue to about $180 million.

Of that, approximately $35 million is currently active, while $145 million in contracted revenue is expected to come online through the fourth quarter of 2026.

## 2,016 NVIDIA Blackwell Ultra GPUs Planned

