SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61238060' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = '4c642749742dbdb11efde84e8844ff88447ea00bccaf05557cf4ebe7a4bf7cbe' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Radhika Anilkumar Nadig", "content": "<p><strong>Harvard Management Co.</strong> disclosed a $2.2 billion stake in <strong>Space Exploration Technologies Corp. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SPCX\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\">SPCX</a>)</a>, an early investment in <strong>Elon Musk</strong>&#8216;s rocket company whose value became public for the first time following SpaceX&#8217;s blockbuster Nasdaq debut in June.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">A Bigger Bet Than Amazon or Nvidia</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The university held 12.94 million shares of SpaceX Class A common stock as of June 30, according to a 13F filing disclosed on Friday. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The stake makes SpaceX Harvard&#8217;s largest disclosed public equity holding, well ahead of its next-largest positions in <strong>Amazon.com, Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AMZN\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AMZN\\">AMZN</a>)</a>, <strong>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co Ltd.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"TSM\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSM\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSM\\">TSM</a>)</a>, <strong>Cerebras Systems Inc </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"CBRS\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CBRS\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CBRS\\">CBRS</a>)</a> and <strong>Nvidia Corp.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a>. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The SpaceX stake accounts for more than half of Harvard&#8217;s $4.3 billion in total U.S. equities disclosed in the filing.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>At Friday&#8217;s closing price, Harvard&#8217;s stake would be worth approximately $1.81 billion. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The University of California&#8217;s investment arm also disclosed a stake in SpaceX, worth roughly $1 billion. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nTSMC’s Arizona Operations Poised for Bigger Profit This Year as Advanced Chip Demand Accelerates: Report</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>SpaceX Stock&#8217;s Volatile Run</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The company went <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/Opinion/26/06/53294290/spacex-had-the-best-ipo-in-history-now-comes-the-hard-part\\">public on the Nasdaq </a>on June 12 and hit an all-time high of around $225 days later, before falling as low as around $104 in early August, a decline of more than 50% from its peak. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Shares have since rebounded after the company <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/60931182/spacex-q2-highlights-double-beat-revenue-up-92-backlog-hits-47-5-billion\\">reported second-quarter revenue </a>of $7.81 billion, up 92% year-over-year and ahead of the $6.93 billion analysts expected. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>SpaceX&#8217;s rebound <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61152207/spacex-stock-surges-past-135-ipo-price-whats-going-on\\">since its post-IPO plunge</a> has also boosted <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61235775/elon-musks-net-worth-jumps-eyes-trillionaire-status-as-spacex-stock-rebounds\\">Elon Musk&#8217;s net worth</a>, which topped $858 billion last week, making him richer than <strong>Larry Page</strong>, <strong>Sergey Brin</strong>, and <strong>Jeff Bezos</strong> combined.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Other Big Investors In SpaceX</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia disclosed a $21 billion stake in SpaceX as of the end of the second quarter, according to its own 13F filing.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Google</strong> parent <strong>Alphabet Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOGL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\">GOOGL</a>)</a> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a> disclosed a <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/07/60673677/spacexs-94-billion-investor-is-also-a-920-million-a-month-customer\\">$94.1 billion stake in SpaceX</a>, with about $80 billion of that stake that had been under short-term sale restrictions and the remaining $14.1 billion locked up through the third quarter of 2027.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Last week, Norway&#8217;s $2.3 trillion sovereign wealth fund revealed a <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/space/26/08/61138978/elon-musks-spacex-lands-1-22-billion-investment-from-norways-2-3-trillion-sovereign-wealth-fund\\">$1.22 billion stake</a> in SpaceX, its first public disclosure of a position in the company.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Price Action:</strong> Shares of SpaceX closed 0.91% lower on Friday at $140 and gained 0.4% in extended trading. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Benzinga edge rankings</strong> indicate<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\"> SpaceX&#8217;s stock</a> has a positive price trend across the short, medium and long term. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPCX\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"1024\\" height=\\"171\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16215035/Capture-37-1024x171.png\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-1604103\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16215035/Capture-37-1024x171.png 1024w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16215035/Capture-37-300x50.png 300w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16215035/Capture-37-768x128.png 768w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16215035/Capture-37.png 1156w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\" /></a></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer:</em></strong><em>&nbsp;This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/topics/26/08/61237560/suze-orman-says-ill-work-longer-isnt-a-retirement-plan-it-can-make-sense-but-is-a-dangerous-strategy\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nSuze Orman Says &#039;I&#039;ll Work Longer&#039; Isn&#039;t a Retirement Plan. It Can Make Sense but Is &#039;a Dangerous Strategy&#039;</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo Courtesy: f11photo on Shutterstock.com</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-17T02:57:49Z", "headline": "Harvard Reveals $2.2 Billion SpaceX Stake, Its Largest Public Equity Holding: University''s Bet on Elon Musk-led Company Outshines Amazon and Nvidia", "id": 61238060, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Cambridge--Ma---May-29-Students-Of-Harva.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Cambridge--Ma---May-29-Students-Of-Harva.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/17/Cambridge--Ma---May-29-Students-Of-Harva.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Harvard disclosed a $2.2 billion stake in SpaceX, an early bet on Musk&#39;s rocket company that has grown since its June debut. ", "symbols": ["AMZN", "CBRS", "GOOG", "GOOGL", "NVDA", "SPCX", "TSM"], "updated_at": "2026-08-17T02:57:50Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61238060/harvard-2-2-billion-spacex-stake-elon-musk-largest-equity"}'::jsonb, '02adcc536b8a60b2952c58de850c4d7df81317c9ee42e4098226efbca8b86725', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000069.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61238060/4c642749742d.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:35.950535+00:00'::timestamptz
