SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61449332' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = 'c74db3189c722d91da8a075d6ea15e8b4649d245594ddaab9d084a12985e1e9e' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Chris Katje", "content": "<p><strong>NVIDIA Corporation </strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> reported second-quarter financial results Wednesday<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/earnings\\"> after market close.</a></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Here are the key highlights.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Nvidia Q2 Earnings</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia reported second-quarter revenue of $96.22 billion, up 106% year-over-year. The revenue total beat a Street consensus estimate of $92.18 billion, according to data <a href=\\"https://benzinga.com/pro/?utm_ad_type=procontent/?utm_source=BZprocontent082626&amp;t=be2bearmibe3na1\\">from Benzinga Pro.</a></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>By segment, revenue was as follows:</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li>Data Center: $89.0 billion, +117% year-over-year</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Edge Computing: $7.2 billion, +27% year-over-year.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Adjusted earnings per share were $2.22 in the quarter, beating a Street consensus estimate of $2.10.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Gross margin was 75.0% in the quarter, up from 74.9% in the first quarter and 72.4% in last year’s second quarter.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The company said Vera Rubin is ramping into full production with<strong> CoreWeave, Nebius, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud </strong>and <strong>Oracle Cloud </strong>named as partners.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"AI has reached its inflection point. It’s doing useful work. Its tokens are productive and profitable. Now, compute is revenue,\\" Nvidia CEO<strong> Jensen Huang</strong> said. \\"And demand is accelerating.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang said the company is seeing \\"strong momentum\\" in the United States and around the world.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"The AI infrastructure buildout is at full steam. Vera Rubin, now in full production, was built to power exactly this moment.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia ended the second quarter with $99.0 billion under its share repurchase authorization plan.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/previews/26/08/61410967/nvidia-q2-preview-spacex-is-becoming-the-fifth-horseman-gene-munster-says\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Q2 Preview: SpaceX Is Becoming the &#039;Fifth Horseman,&#039; Gene Munster Says</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">What’s Next for Nvidia</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia is guiding for third-quarter revenue to be in a range of $105.84 billion to $110.16 billion. This represents year-over-year growth of 85.7% to 93.2% from last year’s $57.01 billion quarterly total for the third quarter.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>This would represent a lower growth rate than in the second quarter, which could explain why the stock is trading lower after hours.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The current Street estimate is $104.20 billion, according to data from Benzinga Pro.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Guidance does not assume any Data Center compute revenue from China. The company said shipments of Data Center Hopper products to China in the second quarter were less than 1% of Data Center revenue.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Nvidia Stock Price Action</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia stock is down 1.8% to $205.94 in after-hours trading Wednesday versus a 52-week trading range of $164.07 to $236.54.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/08/61437286/nvidia-stock-84-of-benzinga-viewers-have-owned-it-heres-how-many-still-do\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Stock: 84% of Benzinga Viewers Have Owned It. Here’s How Many Still Do.</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\\"><div class=\\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\\">\\n<iframe loading=\\"lazy\\" title=\\"Nvidia Q2 FY27 Earnings Call &#x7C; $NVDA &#x7C; &#x1f534; WATCH LIVE\\" width=\\"500\\" height=\\"281\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jhMbFf7jUnw?feature=oembed\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" referrerpolicy=\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image via Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-26T20:44:50Z", "headline": "Nvidia Q2 Highlights: Double Beat, Huang Says ‘AI Infrastructure Buildout is at Full Steam’", "id": 61449332, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/26/Bahia--Brazil---August-29--2025-Nvidia-L.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/26/Bahia--Brazil---August-29--2025-Nvidia-L.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/26/Bahia--Brazil---August-29--2025-Nvidia-L.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Nvidia Q2 highlights, key figures and a look at the company&#39;s updated guidance.", "symbols": ["NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-26T20:44:50Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam"}'::jsonb, 'f57f197d16dabc8fc9f71efd204f8d9cda58bdf32e6948ec7ea67353b7ddbaf3', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61449332/c74db3189c72.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.418185+00:00'::timestamptz
