.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27014256/Aug-27-Polymarket-Odds-For-SP-500-Opening.png 778w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27014256/Aug-27-Polymarket-Odds-For-SP-500-Opening-300x173.png 300w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27014256/Aug-27-Polymarket-Odds-For-SP-500-Opening-768x443.png 768w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 778px) 100vw, 778px\\" /></a></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Why That Number Matters</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Traders are digesting a mix of pivotal tech earnings, resilient consumer data, and complex geopolitical crosscurrents:</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>Higher Index Futures: </strong>Equity futures are pointing to a positive open. Dow Jones futures advanced 0.25%, and S&amp;P 500 futures climbed 0.35%. Nasdaq 100 futures jumped 0.66%, while Russell 2000 futures slipped 0.07%.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Geopolitics &amp; Energy:</strong> Qatari Prime Minister <strong>Sheikh Mohammed bin Abdulrahman al-Thani </strong>is traveling to Tehran to <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/08/61452781/us-iran-ceasefire-to-hold-through-october-crypto-punters-raise-odds-amid-qatars-push-to-revive-negotiations\\">discuss ongoing mediation efforts</a> and encourage a return to U.S.-Iran negotiations. A Qatari spokesperson stated the priority is restoring normal navigation in the Strait of Hormuz and ensuring global energy security. Consequently, energy markets retreated, with Brent crude futures falling to $86.45 a barrel and U.S. West Texas Intermediate (WTI) crude dropping to $81.81 a barrel. </li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Economic Data &amp; Earnings:</strong> Wednesday&#8217;s data revealed that July durable goods orders rose 1.1%, significantly beating economists&#8217; consensus estimate of a 0.4% increase. However, the Personal Consumption Expenditures (PCE) index rose 0.2% in July, surpassing expectations and reigniting debates over potential Fed rate hikes ahead of Fed Chairman <strong>Kevin Warsh</strong>&#8216;s upcoming speech in Jackson Hole. Thursday&#8217;s earnings docket features <strong>Marvell Technology Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"MRVL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MRVL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MRVL\\">MRVL</a>)</a>, <strong>Workday Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"WDAY\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/WDAY\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/WDAY\\">WDAY</a>)</a>, <strong>Dollar General Corp.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"DG\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/DG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/DG\\">DG</a>)</a>, <strong>Dollar Tree Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"DLTR\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/DLTR\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/DLTR\\">DLTR</a>)</a>, and <strong>Ulta Beauty Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"ULTA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ULTA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ULTA\\">ULTA</a>)</a>.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>The Bull Case and Market Outlook</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Investor optimism remains largely anchored to the AI boom and solid corporate fundamentals. Market commentator<strong> Louis Navellier</strong> noted that Nvidia&#8217;s earnings act as the &#8220;grand finale to this incredible earnings announcement season.&#8221; Highlighting massive order backlogs for companies like <strong>GE Vernova Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GEV\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GEV\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GEV\\">GEV</a>)</a>, Navellier emphasized that data centers are demanding unprecedented computing power to support developers like ChatGPT, Claude, and Grok.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Furthermore, Navellier dismissed concerns about political shifts impacting the market, stating that &#8220;the vast majority of federal spending for the next two years has already been front loaded.&#8221; He advised investors to ignore market manipulators and focus on fundamentally superior stocks, asserting that &#8220;good stocks bounce and fundamentals cannot be ignored for very long.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>How the Previous Bet Played Out</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/08/61425878/stock-market-will-sp-500-open-up-or-down-today-24\\">Aug. 26 Polymarket contract</a> resolved &#8220;Down.&#8221; The contract recorded $119,976 in total trading volume.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>On Tuesday, the<strong> SPDR S&amp;P 500 ETF Trust </strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPY\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SPY\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SPY\\">SPY</a>)</a> and <strong>Invesco QQQ Trust ETF</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/QQQ\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"QQQ\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/QQQ\\">QQQ</a>)</a>, which track the S&amp;P 500 and Nasdaq-100, respectively, closed higher. The SPY was up 0.022% to $766.08, while the QQQ advanced by 0.091% to $711.37. Meanwhile, the Dow tracker, <strong>State Street SPDR Dow Jones Industrial Average ETF Trust </strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/DIA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"DIA\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/DIA\\">DIA</a>)</a>, ended 0.19% lower at $534.23.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61432444/trumps-solar-tariffs-could-spark-the-next-intel-style-government-deal-2-stocks-to-watch\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nTrump&#039;s Solar Tariffs Could Spark The Next Intel-Style Government Deal: 2 Stocks To Watch</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer:</em></strong><em> This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo courtesy: Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T06:45:17Z", "headline": "Stock Market: Will S&P 500 Open Up or Down Today?", "id": 61453431, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/SP-500.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/SP-500.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/SP-500.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Will the S&amp;P 500 open higher? Polymarket odds lean bullish at 71% as Street digests Nvidia earnings, PCE data, and Middle East diplomacy.", "symbols": ["DG", "DIA", "DLTR", "GEV", "MRVL", "NVDA", "POLUSD", "QQQ", "SPY", "ULTA", "WDAY"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T06:45:17Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/08/61453431/stock-market-will-sp-500-open-up-or-down-today-25"}'::jsonb, 'db69697719bd46fdf13bbcdf852bd017c11a21948afdeb51cd30173ad3370baa', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61453431/d6b49f040156.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.574354+00:00'::timestamptz
