SELECT d.document_id, (SELECT publisher_id FROM publisher WHERE canonical_key = 'benzinga'), 'media_report', 'Synopsys Posts Upbeat Q3 Results, Joins Okta, Veeva Systems, Crowdstrike And Other Big Stocks Moving Higher On Thursday', false, 'Avi Kapoor', 'U.S. stocks mostly higher, Nasdaq up 1%. Synopsys Inc. reports strong Q3 results and raises outlook. Other gainers include Okta, Veeva, Salesforce, Ooma, Crowdstrike, Sailpoint, Hyperliquid, Tenable, Palo Alto Networks, and Zscaler.', 'U.S. stocks were mostly higher, with the Nasdaq Composite gaining around 1% on Thursday.

Shares of Synopsys Inc (NASDAQ:SNPS) rose sharply as the company reported strong third-quarter results and raised outlook.

Synopsys reported quarterly earnings of $3.91 per share, which beat the analyst consensus estimate of $3.67 by 6.54%, according to Benzinga Pro data. Quarterly revenue of $2.48 billion beat the Street estimate of $2.44 billion and was up from $1.74 billion in the same period last year.

Synopsys shares jumped 8.5% to $445.06 on Thursday.

Here are some other big stocks recording gains in today’s session.

- Okta Inc (NASDAQ:OKTA) shares jumped 22.5% to $164.64 as the company posted upbeat second-quarter results.
- Veeva Systems Inc (NYSE:VEEV) gained 20.5% to $295.00 as the company posted better-than-expected second-quarter results.
- Salesforce Inc (NYSE:CRM) gained 18.8% to $244.79 as the company reported better-than-expected second-quarter financial results and raised its FY27 guidance.
- Ooma Inc (NYSE:OOMA) gained 18.6% to $24.36 following strong quarterly results.
- Crowdstrike Holdings Inc (NASDAQ:CRWD) shares jumped 17.2% to $221.64 after the company reported better-than-expected second-quarter financial results and issued third-quarter sales guidance above estimates.
- Sailpoint Inc (NASDAQ:SAIL) gained 15.5% to $21.04.
- Hyperliquid Strategies Inc (NASDAQ:PURR) jumped 13.3% to $13.10.
- Tenable Holdings Inc (NASDAQ:TENB) gained 11.2% to $37.44. Tenable Holdings will replace Leggett & Platt Inc. (NYSE:LEG) in the S&P SmallCap 600 effective prior to the opening of trading on Monday, Aug. 31.
- Palo Alto Networks Inc (NASDAQ:PANW) gained 11.2% to $377.36 as strong peer earnings fueled a broader cybersecurity rally.
- Zscaler Inc (NASDAQ:ZS) rose 10.9% to $188.89.
- Netskope Inc (NASDAQ:NTSK) gained 10.5% to $15.38.
- Figma Inc (NYSE:FIG) rose 10.3% to $29.82.
- ServiceNow Inc (NYSE:NOW) shares jumped 10% to $138.41 following a blockbuster second-quarter earnings report from enterprise software giant Salesforce Inc.
- Datadog Inc (NASDAQ:DDOG) gained 9.2% to $248.65.
- JFrog Ltd (NASDAQ:FROG) gained 8.7% to $100.87.
- Nutanix Inc (NASDAQ:NTNX) gained 7.9% to $70.56 as the company reported better-than-expected results for the fourth quarter of fiscal 2026.
- NVIDIA Corp (NASDAQ:NVDA) rose 7.5% to $225.41 following strong quarterly results.

