E\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/VEEV\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/VEEV\\">VEEV</a>)</a> gained 20.5% to $295.00 as the company posted better-than-expected second-quarter results.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Salesforce Inc</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"CRM\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CRM\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CRM\\">CRM</a>)</a> gained 18.8% to $244.79 as the company reported better-than-expected second-quarter financial results and raised its FY27 guidance.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Ooma Inc</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"OOMA\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/OOMA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/OOMA\\">OOMA</a>)</a> gained 18.6% to $24.36 following strong quarterly results.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Crowdstrike Holdings Inc</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"CRWD\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CRWD\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/CRWD\\">CRWD</a>)</a> shares jumped 17.2% to $221.64 after the company reported better-than-expected second-quarter financial results and issued third-quarter sales guidance above estimates.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Sailpoint Inc</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SAIL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SAIL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SAIL\\">SAIL</a>)</a> gained 15.5% to $21.04.</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Hyperliquid Strategies Inc</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"PURR\\" data-exchange=\\