SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61502945' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = '3b3b1f07d282bf816529f33f618e84dce79c13edf061d25c35a335a48b846825' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Chris Katje", "content": "<p><strong>NVIDIA Corp </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> stock is up 18% year-to-date in 2026, with shares trading higher this week after the company reported <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam\\">second-quarter financial results</a> and updated guidance. While the stock is gaining value in 2026, another Nvidia item is also seeing increased valuation: autographs from CEO <strong>Jensen Huang.</strong></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Jensen Huang Autograph Up for Auction</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>One of the <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/movers-shakers/26/08/61483661/jensen-huang-passes-mark-zuckerberg-larry-ellison-heres-how-much-nvidia-ceo-is-worth\\">richest people in the world, </a>Nvidia co-founder and CEO Huang has grown into one of the most recognizable figures in the investment world and among the technology sector, often referenced as the \\"Godfather of AI.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Fans of Huang and Nvidia are likely among the bidders on Nvidia- and Huang-related memorabilia that has come up for auction this year, including<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/entertainment/26/07/60294894/jensen-huangs-iconic-leather-jacket-look-can-be-yours-heres-how-much-an-autographed-jacket-might-cost-you\\"> a worn leather jacket </a>from Huang.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Currently up for auction as part of the \\"Fine autographs and artifacts\\" <a href=\\"https://www.rrauction.com/auctions/lot-detail/351606007490091-jensen-huang-twice-signed-nvidia-geforce-rtx-5080-graphics-card/\\">auction </a>from<strong> RR Auction </strong>is a twice-signed <strong>Nvidia GeForce RTX 5080 Graphics Card</strong>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The item features Huang’s signature in black ink on the packaging and a signature in gold ink on the metal housing of the card. The auction includes original packaging and the original shipping box.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Set to close on Sept. 16, the auction has a current high bid of $517. RR Auction estimates the closing price will be $3,000 or more.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>For context, this means you could buy 14 shares of Nvidia for around $3,000 or buy this one-of-a-kind memorabilia piece, assuming it doesn’t go much higher than the auction house estimate.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang’s autograph is one of over 600 signed pieces in the latest RR Auction, with <a href=\\"https://www.rrauction.com/auctions/details/749-fine-autographs-and-artifacts-featuring-art-literature-classical-music-and-animation/?page=1&amp;itemQty=24&amp;view=gallery&amp;sort=hp&amp;cat=0\\">autographs </a>from <strong>The Beatles, Harper Lee, Abraham Lincoln, Bruce Lee </strong>and <strong>John Hancock</strong> also featured.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61495853/nvidia-stock-at-crossroads-expert-says-shares-could-double-or-ai-bubble-could-pop\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Stock at Crossroads: Expert Says Shares ‘Could Double’ or AI Bubble Could Pop</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Recent Jensen Huang Auctions</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>As mentioned above, the auction house estimate is $3,000 for the twice-signed Huang Nvidia graphics card, but there is a good chance the final price ends higher based on recent history.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>In June, a signed Huang trading card sold for $1,836 versus a $1,000 pre-auction estimate.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>In July, <strong>Sotheby’s </strong><a href=\\"https://www.sothebys.com/en/buy/auction/2026/the-ceos-uniform-jensen-huangs-tom-ford-leather-jacket/the-jensen-jacket-jensen-huangs-tom-ford-leather\\">auctioned </a>an iconic Tom Ford leather jacket worn by Huang. The jacket had an auction house estimate of $40,000 to $60,000, but ended up sold for a winning bid of $960,000.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>On RR Auction, there were several Huang pieces <a href=\\"https://www.rrauction.com/search/?str=jensen+huang&amp;flexdatalist-str=jensen+huang&amp;type=t&amp;status=closed&amp;navsearch=true\\">sold </a>earlier this month, including a Huang-autographed picture sold for $1,169, easily beating the $400 pre-auction estimate, and a twice-signed RTX Pro 6000 Blackwell that sold for $57,450, significantly higher than the $6,000 estimate.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Earlier this year, a twice-signed GeForce RTX 5090 Founders Edition GPU sold for $10,005 in March via RR Auction, beating a pre-auction estimate of $8,000.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang-signed merchandise and Nvidia memorabilia are in a market that is heating up, and the latest auction could show if demand is still there with Nvidia the most valuable company in the world.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/dividends/26/05/52812431/nvidia-dividend-boost-will-make-jensen-huang-810-million-richer-every-year\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Dividend Boost Will Make Jensen Huang $810 Million Richer — Every Year</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image via Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-28T17:50:07Z", "headline": "What’s Hotter Than Nvidia Stock? Jensen Huang Autograph Action Heats Up: Signed Graphics Card Auction Cost", "id": 61502945, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "The market for Nvidia memorabilia and Jensen Huang autographs is heating up. Here&#39;s the latest item up for auction.", "symbols": ["NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-28T17:50:07Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61502945/whats-hotter-than-nvidia-stock-jensen-huang-autograph-action-heats-up-signed-graphics-card-auction-cost"}'::jsonb, '5cf42419beb3b6f301e296e0755e281da605af20593b72c2111bb94268000bde', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61502945/3b3b1f07d282.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:37.042075+00:00'::timestamptz
