arkets/equities/26/08/61454942/stock-market-today-sp-500-nasdaq-100-futures-gain-while-dow-slips-following-nvda-blockbuster-q2-report-crm-crwd-hpq-in-focus\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nStock Market Today: S&amp;P 500, Nasdaq 100 Futures Gain, While Dow Slips Following NVDA Blockbuster Q2 Report&mdash; CRM, CRWD, HPQ in Focus</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div><h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Accelerating AI Demand</strong></h2><p>&ldquo;AI has reached its inflection point. It&rsquo;s doing useful work. Its tokens are productive and profitable. Now, compute is revenue,&rdquo; Nvidia CEO <strong>Jensen Huang </strong>said. &ldquo;And demand is accelerating.&rdquo; Huang added, &ldquo;The AI infrastructure buildout is at full steam. Vera Rubin, now in full production, was built to power exactly this moment.&rdquo;</p><p>Nvidia expects third-quarter revenue between $105.84 billion and $110.16 billion, representing 85.7% to 93.2% year-over-year growth. The outlook beats the Street estimate of $104.20 billion.</p><h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Technical Analysis</h2><p>At $260.00, ARM is trading about 0.4% below its 20-day SMA ($260.55), which puts the stock right on a near-term decision point rather than clearly trending. The bigger picture is still mixed: it&rsquo;s trading 11.8% below its 50-day SMA ($294.28) and 4.3% below its 100-day SMA ($271.27), but remains 30.8% above its 200-day SMA ($198.40).</p><p>From a trend-structure standpoint, the 20-day SMA sitting below the 50-day SMA keeps the short-term posture cautious, even as the longer-term &ldquo;golden cross&rdquo; from April (50-day above the 200-day) still argues the broader uptrend hasn&rsquo;t fully broken. Traders will also remember the stock&rsquo;s June swing high and the more recent August swing low as the current range markers that define where breakouts or breakdowns can accelerate.</p><ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>Key Resistance</strong>: $299.50 &mdash; lines up near the $300 round-number area and sits close to the 50-day SMA ($294.28), a common spot where rebounds can stall</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Key Support</strong>: $243 &mdash; a nearby floor that sits below current price and can act as the next &ldquo;line in the sand&rdquo; if the pullback resumes</li>\\n</ul><p><strong>ARM Price Action:</strong> ARM Holdings shares were up 4.81% at $263.12 at the time of publication on Thursday, <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/pro/\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\">according to Benzinga Pro data</a>.</p><div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\" data-variant=\\"card\\" data-news-mode=\\"manual\\">\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/news/politics/26/08/61453595/trump-trade-chief-greer-says-canada-was-offered-best-deal-in-the-world-but-talks-hit-a-wall-over-truck-tariffs-we-dont-have-open-channels\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nTrump Trade Chief Greer Says Canada Was Offered &lsquo;Best Deal&rsquo; in the World, but Talks Hit a Wall Over Truck Tariffs: &lsquo;We Don&rsquo;t Have Open Channels&rsquo;</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div><p><em>Image via Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T14:01:59Z", "headline": "Why Is Arm Stock Surging on Thursday?", "id": 61464567, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Arm-Company-Logo-Seen-On-Stm32-Microchip.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Arm-Company-Logo-Seen-On-Stm32-Microchip.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Arm-Company-Logo-Seen-On-Stm32-Microchip.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Arm Holdings PLC (NASDAQ: ARM) stock surges Thursday following Nvidia’s Q2 financial results and optimistic guidance for AI infrastructure buildout.", "symbols": ["ARM", "NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T14:01:59Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61464567/why-is-arm-stock-surging-on-thursday"}'::jsonb, '349dcfb424f18565636c5e55882ea91ef0eaed9f1bad86ff73ad29ae5511e565', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61464567/d2c71ac5939a.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.777636+00:00'::timestamptz
