SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61466724' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = '48e0bdf88002e4e1ba6a76a80f57e072b47feffc3646e3d7f950f90379b35b36' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Anusuya Lahiri", "content": "<p><strong>Super Micro Computer, Inc. </strong><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SMCI\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SMCI\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SMCI\\">SMCI</a>)</a> stock gained over 3% on Thursday as <strong>NVIDIA Corp.’s</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> latest earnings reinforced optimism around AI infrastructure demand, while S&amp;P 500 futures rose 0.50%.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia and Supermicro are closely linked through AI infrastructure. Nvidia supplies GPUs, networking chips and AI software, while Supermicro integrates those technologies into high-performance servers, racks and cooling systems.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Supermicro is also often among the first hardware vendors to deploy new Nvidia architectures, making it an important partner in bringing Nvidia-powered AI systems into data centers.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Nvidia Results Keep AI Hardware Demand In Focus</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia stock jumped more than 7% premarket after reporting second-quarter revenue of $96.22 billion, beating the $92.18 billion estimate. Adjusted EPS of $2.22 also topped the $2.10 estimate, while gross margin reached 75.0%.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The results kept AI hardware stocks such as Super Micro in focus as <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/analyst-stock-ratings/analyst-color/26/08/61454764/nvidia-is-still-the-ai-bellwether-and-rivals-arent-close\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\">investors reacted to</a> Nvidia’s latest AI-demand commentary.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia also guided third-quarter revenue to between $105.84 billion and $110.16 billion and ended the quarter with $99.0 billion remaining under its share repurchase authorization.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Analyst Consensus &amp; Recent Actions:</strong> Super Micro stock carries a Hold rating with an <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SMCI/price-targets\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\">average price forecast</a> of $36.20. Recent analyst moves include:</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>Citigroup</strong>: Neutral (Raises Forecast to $39.00) (Aug. 12)</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Goldman Sachs</strong>: Sell (Raises Forecast to $34.00) (Aug. 12)</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Mizuho</strong>: Neutral (Raises Forecast to $35.00) (Aug. 12)</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Top ETF Exposure</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li><strong>iShares Future AI &amp; Tech ETF</strong> (NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/ARTY\\">ARTY</a>): 3.46% Weight</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>VanEck Preferred Securities ex Financials ETF</strong> (NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/PFXF\\">PFXF</a>): 4.10% Weight</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li><strong>Defiance Daily Target 2X Long SMCI ETF</strong> (NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SMCX\\">SMCX</a>): 26.74% Weight</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Significance:</strong> Because SMCI carries such a heavy weight in these funds, any significant inflows or outflows for these ETFs will likely force automatic buying or selling of the stock.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>SMCI Price Action:</strong> Super Micro Computer shares were up 2.70% to $38.39 at the time of publication on Thursday, <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/pro/\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\">according to Benzinga Pro data</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61456036/whats-going-on-with-marvell-technology-stock-thursday-5\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nWhat&#039;s Going On With Marvell Technology Stock Thursday?</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo: Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T14:35:34Z", "headline": "Inside Supermicro''s Stock Gain: How NVIDIA''s Record Q2 Drives Data Center Demand", "id": 61466724, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Supermicro.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Supermicro.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Supermicro.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Supermicro stock jumped over 4% premarket following Nvidia&#39;s standout Q2 earnings, highlighting continued strong demand for high-performance AI server infrastructure.", "symbols": ["ARTY", "NVDA", "PFXF", "SMCI", "SMCX"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T14:35:34Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61466724/inside-supermicros-stock-gain-how-nvidias-record-q2-drives-data-center-demand"}'::jsonb, '2c4c40b80ef0485d37c8181bc046af9766baa819102f53962f448c5fed23d665', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61466724/48e0bdf88002.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.816982+00:00'::timestamptz
