SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61470458' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = 'f346e58a06cc13e79e0f741059e09f2ecd5dd73c4239294535decd07a8ba6630' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Surbhi Jain", "content": "<p>As leading AI developers race to build their own custom chips, <strong>Nvidia Corp</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> CEO <strong>Jensen Huang</strong> says he remains unfazed. Responding to questions about <strong>OpenAI</strong>, <strong>Anthropic</strong> and other frontier AI labs designing in-house silicon, Huang said he is &#8220;100% confident&#8221; they will remain Nvidia customers and partners &#8220;for a very long time.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Huang Says Nvidia Is Building an AI Platform, Not Just Chips</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Speaking during Nvidia&#8217;s earnings call, Huang argued that many custom AI processors are designed for narrow inference workloads, while Nvidia offers a broader platform spanning the entire AI lifecycle.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;We&#8217;re building something very different,&#8221; Huang said. &#8220;These XPUs are inference specific chips for one cloud or one service. NVIDIA Corp is a platform, an entire AI factory platform that spans the entire AI life cycle.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>He added that as AI services expand globally, they will continue to rely on Nvidia&#8217;s infrastructure beyond their own data centers.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;I fully expect&#8230; they&#8217;re going to run on NVIDIA Corp all around the world,&#8221; Huang said, adding that he has &#8220;100% confidence&#8221; the frontier AI labs &#8220;are going to be customers and partners of ours for a very long time.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang also framed Nvidia&#8217;s investments in frontier AI companies as a long-term strategic opportunity rather than a competitive risk.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;Investing in these companies are once in a generation opportunity,&#8221; he said. &#8220;The only regret that I have is that I didn&#8217;t invest more and sooner.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The remarks come as several leading AI developers, including OpenAI and Anthropic, pursue custom chip programs aimed at reducing dependence on third-party hardware for certain workloads. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang&#8217;s message to investors was that proprietary inference chips and Nvidia&#8217;s end-to-end AI platform can coexist—and that the world&#8217;s biggest AI labs are likely to keep buying both.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T15:46:14Z", "headline": "QUICK SPARK: Jensen Huang Is ''100% Confident'' Frontier AI Labs Will Remain Nvidia Customers", "id": 61470458, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Jensen Huang says he&#39;s &#34;100% confident&#34; frontier AI labs will remain Nvidia customers despite developing custom AI chips.", "symbols": ["NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T15:46:14Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61470458/jensen-huang-nvidia-customers"}'::jsonb, 'c0cd0d3ea0bcf31b4f2c1bcbbacd7380879d3c343c3ea748915bc0ae0c1e9e48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/