SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61460237' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = 'a81914ecc3a02b58e804ed82490d9477ce91284c6a2ff15826dd9df5afbfc73a' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Lekha Gupta", "content": "<p><strong>Nebius Group</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NBIS\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NBIS\\">NBIS</a>)</a> stock rose more than 6% in Thursday’s premarket trading. <strong>NVIDIA Corp.’s</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/node/61449952\\">AI hardware supply</a> update lifted sentiment around computing infrastructure stocks. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nasdaq futures are up 0.81% while S&amp;P 500 futures have gained 0.26%.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">NVIDIA Names Nebius as First Customer</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>During NVIDIA’s earnings call Wednesday, the company’s chief financial officer said volume shipments of Groq 3 LPX should begin later this quarter. Nebius is <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam\\">expected to become the first customer</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>NVIDIA reported second-quarter revenue of $96.22 billion, up 106% from a year earlier. Revenue beat Wall Street’s estimate of $92.18 billion. Adjusted earnings totaled $2.22 per share, topping the consensus estimate of $2.10.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Technical Analysis</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nebius remained in a strong long-term uptrend. The stock traded about 50% above its 200-day simple moving average of $150.79. It was also about 11% above its 100-day SMA of $204.69.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>In addition, shares traded 2% to 3% above their 20-day and 50-day averages. That keeps the short-term trend positive.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The relative strength index stood at 48.11, which signals neutral momentum. However, the 20-day SMA remained below the 50-day SMA. That bearish crossover suggests the stock is still digesting an earlier rally.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Resistance stands near $230. Support sits around $200.50, close to a previous pivot and below the 100-day SMA.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Analyst Outlook</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The stock has a consensus Buy rating and an <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NBIS/price-targets\\">average price forecast</a> of $248.83. <strong>Citigroup </strong>recently raised its forecast to $324 and maintained a Buy rating. <strong>DA Davidson</strong> raised its forecast to $250 while keeping a Neutral rating.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Benzinga Edge Rankings</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nebius has a Momentum score of 97.87, according to the <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/screener\\">Benzinga Edge Stock Rankings</a>. However, its Value score stands at 4.53. The scores point to strong price momentum but a demanding valuation.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">ETF Exposure</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The <strong>Leverage Shares 2X Long NBIS Daily ETF</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NBIG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NBIG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NBIG\\">NBIG</a>)</a> has 111.6% exposure to Nebius. Therefore, fund inflows and outflows could increase buying or selling pressure on the stock.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Price Action</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nebius shares rose 6.25% to $227.30 in Thursday’s premarket session, according to <a href=\\"https://benzinga.com/services\\">Benzinga Pro</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo via Shutterstock</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/offerings/26/08/61329381/nebius-upsizes-convertible-offering-to-5-billion-as-ai-expansion-accelerates\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNebius Upsizes Convertible Offering to $5 Billion As AI Expansion Accelerates</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T12:53:28Z", "headline": "Why Is Nebius Group Stock Soaring Thursday?", "id": 61460237, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Nebius-Group.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Nebius-Group.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Nebius-Group.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Nebius (NBIS) stock surges 6% premarket after NVIDIA names it as the first customer for its upcoming Groq 3 LPX hardware.", "symbols": ["NBIG", "NBIS", "NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T12:58:42Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/08/61460237/why-is-nebius-group-stock-soaring-thursday"}'::jsonb, 'fe1a786a45296d73d26f9402b1b0c68c09ebfc68c2db963a1748c7546bf6d3a5', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61460237/a81914ecc3a0.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.720230+00:00'::timestamptz
