sode.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>\\"Nvidia is the most valuable company in the world. Which of the following best describes you?\\" Benzinga asked.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The results are:</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li>Traded Nvidia stock before, but don’t own: 45%</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Currently own Nvidia stock: 39%</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Never owned Nvidia stock (outside ETFs/Mutual Funds): 16%</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The poll results show that 45% of viewers polled have owned Nvidia stock in the past, but don’t currently own it. Add this to the 39% who say they currently own Nvidia stock, and the amount of people who have owned Nvidia stock at some point would be 84%.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The remaining 16% of viewers said they have never owned Nvidia stock outside of ETFs or mutual funds that own Nvidia stock, which would give them indirect ownership.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;<a href=\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bE9Y6C8LZTk&amp;list=PL4k0fH8EgI3ZVRPM7INpG--GvohnBVTnT\\">PreMarket Playbook</a>&#8221; airs on YouTube Monday through Friday at 8 a.m. ET and is hosted by&nbsp;<strong>Ryan Faloona</strong>. The poll in this story featured responses from 216 viewers.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/previews/26/08/61388955/nvidia-earnings-preview-stock-has-dropped-after-5-of-last-6-reports-and-a-simple-beat-may-not-be-enough\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Earnings Preview: Stock Has Dropped After 5 of Last 6 Reports, and &#039;A Simple Beat May Not Be Enough&#039;</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Comparing with Tesla, Apple Stock</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Benzinga has previously polled its \\"PreMarket Playbook\\" viewers about ownership of several Magnificent Seven stocks.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Asking the same question<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/06/60198339/tesla-stock-73-of-benzinga-viewers-have-owned-it-heres-how-many-still-do\\"> about stock ownership, </a>here are the results from 214 viewers for<strong> Tesla Inc</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"TSLA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSLA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/TSLA\\">TSLA</a>)</a> stock:</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li>Traded Tesla before, but don’t own: 53%</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Never owned Tesla stock (outside ETFs/mutual funds): 27%</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Currently own Tesla stock: 20%</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Asking the same question <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/08/61223517/apple-stock-64-of-benzinga-viewers-have-owned-it-heres-how-many-still-do\\">about stock ownership,</a> here are the results from 214 viewers for<strong> Apple Inc </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"AAPL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AAPL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/AAPL\\">AAPL</a>)</a> stock:</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<ul class=\\"wp-block-list\\">\\n<li>Traded Apple stock, but don’t own: 41%</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Never owned Apple stock (outside ETFs/mutual funds): 36%</li>\\n\\n\\n\\n<li>Currently own Apple stock: 23%</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The polls show that 73% of viewers have owned Tesla stock at some point and 64% have owned Apple stock at some point. Those are both significantly lower than the 84% who said they have owned Nvidia stock at some point.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>This may point to Nvidia stock being more popular with retail investors. Nvidia also takes the crown for current stock ownership, with 39% saying they own the stock now, beating out the 23% who owned Apple and the 20% who owned Tesla in Benzinga&#8217;s respective polls.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>All three stocks remain popular with Benzinga viewers and readers. In the first half of 2026, Nvidia, Tesla and Apple ranked third, fourth and sixth, respectively, for <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/07/60266829/exclusive-top-12-most-searched-tickers-for-first-half-of-2026-where-do-micron-nvidia-tesla-sandisk-rank\\">searches on Benzinga Pro.</a></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Watch the Aug. 25, 2026 &#8220;PreMarket Playbook&#8221; episode below: </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\\"><div class=\\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\\">\\n<iframe loading=\\"lazy\\" title=\\"$BTC Nears $80K as Tech Rebounds Before $NVDA Call &#x7C; PreMarket Playbook + T3 Live &#x7C; August 25, 2026\\" width=\\"500\\" height=\\"281\\" src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rWDcBchKsM0?feature=oembed\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" referrerpolicy=\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n</div></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/large-cap/26/05/52419874/exclusive-nvidia-vs-alphabet-benzinga-viewers-prediction-markets-disagree-on-the-most-valuable-mag-7-stock-by-2026\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nEXCLUSIVE: Nvidia Vs. Alphabet: Benzinga Viewers, Prediction Markets Disagree On The Most Valuable Mag 7 Stock By 2026</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo: Samuel Boivin / Shutterstock &#8211; ek</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-26T14:50:53Z", "headline": "Nvidia Stock: 84% of Benzinga Viewers Have Owned It. Here’s How Many Still Do.", "id": 61437286, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/26/In-This-Photographic-Illustration--The-N.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/26/In-This-Photographic-Illustration--The-N.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/26/In-This-Photographic-Illustration--The-N.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Benzinga polled viewers of its daily YouTube show to find out how many currently own Nvidia stock and have traded the stock in the past.", "symbols": ["AAPL", "NVDA", "TSLA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-26T14:50:53Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/08/61437286/nvidia-stock-84-of-benzinga-viewers-have-owned-it-heres-how-many-still-do"}'::jsonb, '89879f51ee12117f7aadb4d77b981daf68e832518aba9838c07569e87ad940dd', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61437286/a8a46f8d556b.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.310822+00:00'::timestamptz
