SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61486111' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = '0e403ca5352783d10f239c8bff56debaf06443c83ae079f1dcddf269419cf670' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Mohd Haider", "content": "<p>South Korean chipmaker <strong>SK Hynix</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"SKHY\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SKHY\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SKHY\\">SKHY</a>)</a> said Thursday it will begin volume production of next-generation HBM4E chips at its Indiana facility in the third quarter of 2029, as CEO <strong>Kwak Noh-Jung</strong> warned the current memory shortage will persist through 2030.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Billion-Dollar Bet on U.S. AI Supply Chain</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The more than $4 billion project will expand SK Hynix’s presence in the United States as growing AI investment drives demand for high-bandwidth memory. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The site at Purdue Research Park will allow the company to produce chips closer to major customers such as <strong>Nvidia </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a>, <strong>Microsoft </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"MSFT\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MSFT\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MSFT\\">MSFT</a>)</a>, and <strong>Alphabet </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOGL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\">GOOGL</a>)</a>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Jung said, &#8220;The United States is the epicenter of AI innovation, bringing together premier customers, top-tier R&amp;D capabilities, and partners, and the Indiana fab will become a gateway to deliver first Made in USA HBM products.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Dominant Market Position Reinforces Bullish Outlook</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>According to <a href=\\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/insights/global-dram-and-hbm-market-share\\">Counterpoint Research</a>, SK Hynix held 58% of the global HBM market by revenue in the first quarter of 2026, outpacing <strong>Samsung Electronics</strong> and<strong> Micron Technology</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"MU\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MU\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MU\\">MU</a>)</a>, each at 21%.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia, a major SK Hynix customer, <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61451188/nvidias-real-story-isnt-the-beat-its-what-kress-said-about-2028\\">forecast a 70% jump in revenue</a> for the next fiscal year, reinforcing confidence in sustained AI-chip demand and supporting Kwak&#8217;s view that the memory upcycle has room to run.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The U.S. government supported the project with $458 million in CHIPS Act grants and up to $500 million in loans, with the funding finalized in December 2024.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Trading Metrics</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>SK Hynix has a market capitalization of approximately $912.37 billion. Its stock has traded between a 52-week high of $194.45 and a 52-week low of $124.80.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Over the past month, the large-cap stock gained 24.15%.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Needham </strong>analyst <strong>N. Quinn Bolton</strong> raised his <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SKHY/price-targets\\">price target on SK Hynix to $220 from $200</a> on Monday, maintaining a Buy rating.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Price Action:</strong> SKHY closed the regular session on Thursday at $161.61, up 2.27%, according to <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/pro/register-3\\">Benzinga Pro</a> data. The stock is down 0.58% in after-hours trading.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>With a strong Growth score of 98.37, <strong>Benzinga&#8217;s Edge Stock Rankings</strong> indicate that SKHY has a <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SKHY\\">positive price trend</a> across all time frames.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\\"><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/SKHY\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"408\\" height=\\"242\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28022439/image-756.png\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-1622026\\" style=\\"width:491px;height:auto\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28022439/image-756.png 408w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28022439/image-756-300x178.png 300w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px\\" /></a></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer:</em></strong><em> This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61236189/anthropic-ai-agents-disabling-rivals-evading-safety-restrictions\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nAnthropic Says Its AI Agents Are Killing Rivals and Evading Safety Controls: Here&#039;s What the Company&#039;s Risk Report Found</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo courtesy: JHVEPhoto / Shutterstock.com</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-28T07:04:58Z", "headline": "SK Hynix CEO Warns Memory Shortage Will Persist Through 2030 as Chipmaker Builds $4 Billion Indiana Fab", "id": 61486111, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Sk-Hynix-America-Headquarters-In-San-Jos.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Sk-Hynix-America-Headquarters-In-San-Jos.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Sk-Hynix-America-Headquarters-In-San-Jos.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "SK Hynix plans to begin HBM4E production in Indiana by 2029 as AI demand fuels a prolonged memory shortage.", "symbols": ["GOOG", "GOOGL", "MSFT", "MU", "NVDA", "SKHY"], "updated_at": "2026-08-28T07:04:58Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61486111/sk-hynix-ceo-memory-shortage-2030-4-billion-indiana-fab"}'::jsonb, '7877a475837ee4a8b8a65e89bca3e4e2f7cf0d3fd437ee4469d9e404ccaa79df', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61486111/0e403ca53527.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.966336+00:00'::timestamptz
