\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-full\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"591\\" height=\\"747\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27220138/Capture-67.png\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-1621843\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27220138/Capture-67.png 591w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27220138/Capture-67-237x300.png 237w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 591px) 100vw, 591px\\" /></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Earlier this month, the chipmaker announced the <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/large-cap/26/08/61330501/micron-unveils-10-billion-research-labs-to-advance-memory-and-ai\\">Micron Research Labs</a>, a U.S.-based hub anchored by a flagship campus in Boise, Idaho, focused on advancing memory and AI technologies over the next decade.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;I have made it clear that America will lead the way to a new Golden Age of Science,&#8221; Trump added. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Tariff Uncertainty Looms Over the Industry</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The praise comes as the Trump administration considers <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61456385/trump-weighs-new-semiconductor-tariffs-that-could-hit-ai-data-center-servers-laptops-and-gaming-consoles-report\\">new semiconductor tariffs</a> that could extend to laptops, gaming consoles, and data center servers, POLITICO <a href=\\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/08/27/data-centers-chips-tariffs-threat-01050957?tblci=https://www.politico.com/news/2026/08/27/data-centers-chips-tariffs-threat-01050957?tblci=GiCNFfqZFu8ScwKBjoai2DKVbr8oL3VZhaCNYu5KnPmU6yCN1Vco_tHsz7at7IM0MO-ISg-ISg\\">reported</a> on Thursday.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Tech companies have started lobbying against the proposal, warning it could raise costs and slow the AI data center buildout. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Micron is currently the only U.S.-based manufacturer of high-bandwidth memory, a component the administration has framed as central to domestic AI supply chain security.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Trump&#8217;s Broader Stock Activity in Both Companies</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Trump&#8217;s earlier disclosure, filed in May, showed more than a dozen separate Nvidia transactions during the first quarter of 2026, including purchases and sales ranging from $1,001 to $1 million, along with several Micron purchases ranging from $1,001 to $250,000.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>In his most recent disclosure earlier this month, he sold between $15,001 and $50,000 of Nvidia stock on June 23, with no Micron transactions reported during that period.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Price Action: </strong>Nvidia&#8217;s shares closed 8.74% higher on Thursday at $227.98 and fell 0.81% in extended trading. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>According to <strong>Benzinga Edge rankings</strong>, <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">Nvidia&#8217;s stock</a> has a Momentum score in the 50th percentile and a Growth score in the 99th percentile.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"1024\\" height=\\"165\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27212156/Capture-66-1024x165.png\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-1621835\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27212156/Capture-66-1024x165.png 1024w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27212156/Capture-66-300x48.png 300w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27212156/Capture-66-768x124.png 768w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27212156/Capture-66.png 1171w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\" /></a></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61479509/trump-trade-deficit-ai-buildout-memory-chips-south-korea-july-2026\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nTrump&#039;s Tariffs Were Built to Close the Trade Gap. The AI Buildout Is Keeping It Open</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer</em>:</strong><em>&nbsp;This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors</em>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Image via Shutterstock/ Joey Sussman</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-28T02:12:15Z", "headline": "Trump Praises Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang On ''Incredible Numbers,'' Calls Micron One Of The World''s ''Hottest'' Companies", "id": 61485079, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Policy-Changes-Add-Pressure.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Policy-Changes-Add-Pressure.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/28/Policy-Changes-Add-Pressure.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Trump celebrated Nvidia&#39;s robust revenue guidance and Micron&#39;s new $10 billion research investment as proof his policies are working.", "symbols": ["MU", "NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-28T02:12:15Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61485079/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-incredible-numbers-micron-hottest-company"}'::jsonb, '802125f64bf5069e6e984690a935122f692f0c2f676517d7b818ba16545cab94', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61485079/643f75508355.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.952425+00:00'::timestamptz
