//www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOGL\\">GOOGL</a>)</a> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"GOOG\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/GOOG\\">GOOG</a>)</a>, which valued the AI startup at $4.5 billion.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>This development is particularly noteworthy as closed-source model builders like <strong>Anthropic </strong>and <strong>OpenAI </strong>are exploring alternatives to Nvidia&#8217;s graphics processing units. This acquisition could be one of the largest by Nvidia so far, as per reports. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Nvidia and Hugging Face did not immediately respond to Benzinga&#8217;s request for comments.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61452739/nvidia-revenue-18x-growth-4-years-analyst-history\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Revenue Set to Increase 18X in 4 Years; Analyst Says &#039;Never in History&#039; Has a Company Grown This Fast</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Hugging Face Emerges As Key AI Target</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Earlier this year, the Financial Times <a href=\\"https://www.ft.com/content/d14419c5-7fa5-4128-9858-7f83259ca02e?syn-25a6b1a6=1\\">reported </a>that Hugging Face rejected a proposed $500 million investment from Nvidia late last year that would have valued the AI startup at $7 billion. The company said it wanted to avoid having a single dominant investor influence its decisions. With 13 million users, Hugging Face has become a major hub for open AI models, helping developers and companies, including China’s <strong>DeepSeek </strong>and <strong>Alibaba Group Holding Ltd &#8211; ADR</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"BABA\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/BABA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/BABA\\">BABA</a>)</a>, distribute their AI technologies globally.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>On Sunday, a report stated that Hugging Face <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61374037/hugging-face-thirteen-billion-sale-openai-security-breach\\">was exploring</a> a potential sale that could value the company at $13 billion or more. The firm faced a security breach a month earlier after an <strong>OpenAI </strong>model <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/60990233/openais-rogue-agents-built-their-own-message-boards-and-grew-paranoid-of-each-other-months-before-hugging-face-breach-staffers-reveal\\">went rogue</a> and compromised its infrastructure.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Notably, this report comes as Nvidia&#8217;s Q2 financial results highlighted a 106% year-over-year <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam\\">increase in revenue</a>, reaching $96.22 billion. The company&#8217;s CEO, <strong>Jensen Huang</strong>, stated that the &#8216;AI infrastructure buildout is at full steam,&#8217; indicating Nvidia&#8217;s aggressive expansion in the AI sector. The chipmaker also said it has $18 billion in equity investments committed through fiscal year 2027.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer</em>:</strong><em>&nbsp;This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors</em>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/07/60685593/hugging-face-ceo-urges-openai-to-release-rogue-ai-logs-commit-100-million-in-compute-after-breach\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nHugging Face CEO Urges OpenAI to Release Rogue AI Logs, Commit $100 Million in Compute After Breach</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo courtesy: Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T06:30:42Z", "headline": "Nvidia Agrees to Acquire Hugging Face For $12.9 Billion In One of Its Largest Acquisitions So Far As It Expands Control Of Open-Source AI Models: Report", "id": 61453368, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/The-modern-Nvidia-logo-and-company-name-.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/The-modern-Nvidia-logo-and-company-name-.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/The-modern-Nvidia-logo-and-company-name-.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Nvidia reportedly agrees to acquire Hugging Face for $12.9 Billion, expanding its AI reach as OpenAI and Anthropic seek GPU alternatives.", "symbols": ["BABA", "CRM", "GOOG", "GOOGL", "NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T06:30:42Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61453368/nvidia-agrees-to-acquire-hugging-face-for-12-9-billion-in-one-of-its-largest-acquisitions-so-far-as-it-expands-control-of-open-source-ai-models-report"}'::jsonb, '873a528878c11bd693d98e4f1fd4c6d2dc9a597702a99c5d75e93e9afa2f3e65', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61453368/cca64a6c313a.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.568327+00:00'::timestamptz
