SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61454688' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = 'ae9dcfd9fb2833be99359c8df7c61e45e6c2ab557d49065614ae1f85d0f10d59' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Radhika Anilkumar Nadig", "content": "<p><strong>Nvidia Corp. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> CEO <strong>Jensen Huang</strong> has learned that a single sentence from him can move billions in market value, and on Wednesday, he joked about wielding that power over dinner.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>&#8220;Their Stock Price Doubles the Next Day&#8221;</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>When a Goldman Sachs analyst asked Huang to rank the biggest supply constraints facing the company&#8217;s growth, power, memory, and foundry capacity on the company&#8217;s <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam\\">second-quarter earnings</a> call, he deflected with a joke instead.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;Last year, one of the funniest things to do is just to go figure out where I go for dinner and who I have dinner with, and their stock price doubled the next day.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>He then pivoted back to a serious answer, saying NVIDIA&#8217;s &#8220;entire supply chain is challenged&#8221; and that the company is &#8220;running flat out&#8221; to bring more capacity online.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61453881/jim-cramer-slams-wall-streets-reaction-to-metas-17-billion-settlement-as-ridiculous-somehow-the-narrative-has-turned\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nJim Cramer Slams Wall Street&#039;s Reaction to META&#039;s $17 Billion Settlement as &#039;Ridiculous&#039;: &#039;Somehow the Narrative Has Turned…&#039;</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>A Fried Chicken Dinner That Moved Markets</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>In October 2025, he dined with <strong>Samsung Electronics</strong> Chairman <strong>Lee Jae-yong</strong> and <strong>Hyundai Motor Group</strong> Chairman <strong>Chung Eui-sun</strong> at a popular fried chicken restaurant in Seoul, and the <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/personal-finance/entrepreneurship/25/11/48581173/these-high-profile-tech-tycoons-dinner-outing-triggers-fried-chicken-stock-surge-in-south-korea\\">outing went viral</a>, sending shares of local fried chicken chains soaring in South Korea.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>The dinner came as Huang announced Nvidia would supply more GPUs to South Korean firms, including Samsung and Hyundai.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>A Real Pattern, Not Just a Joke</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Shares of<strong> Marvell Technology Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"MRVL\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MRVL\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/MRVL\\">MRVL</a>)</a> climbed as much as 32% in a single session in June after Huang called it the &#8220;<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/06/52936400/nvidia-ceo-crowns-marvell-the-next-trillion-dollar-company-stock-explodes-20\\">next $1 trillion company</a>&#8221; at Computex, then extended those gains the following day.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>At the same conference, Huang pushed back on fears that AI would wipe out the industry, saying &#8220;this is actually an incredible time to be a software company.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Software stocks rallied sharply on his comments, with the<strong> iShares Expanded Tech-Software Sector ETF</strong> <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/IGV\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"IGV\\" data-exchange=\\"BATS\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(BATS:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/IGV\\">IGV</a>)</a> gaining nearly 6%. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>In January, Quantum computing names, including <strong>D-Wave Quantum Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"QBTS\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/QBTS\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/QBTS\\">QBTS</a>)</a>, <strong>Rigetti Computing Inc.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"RGTI\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/RGTI\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/RGTI\\">RGTI</a>)</a>, and <strong>IonQ Inc. </strong><a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"IONQ\\" data-exchange=\\"NYSE\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/IONQ\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NYSE:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/IONQ\\">IONQ</a>)</a>, fell after Huang said <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/25/01/42966492/jensen-huang-said-quantum-computing-is-20-years-away-but-nvidia-bets-big-on-strategic-hiring\\">practical quantum computing</a> was likely 20 years away. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Then months later, those same <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/04/51863200/jensen-huang-just-pulled-quantum-computing-into-nvidias-orbit\\">stocks rallied again</a> after he reversed course and called the technology an &#8220;inflection point.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\">Nvidia Beats Across the Board, Guides Above Estimates</h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Nvidia reported <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam\\">second-quarter revenue</a> of $96.22 billion, above the $92.11 billion analysts expected, with adjusted earnings of $2.22 per share, ahead of the $2.09 forecast by Wall Street, according to <a href=\\"https://pro.benzinga.com/dashboard/?tblci=GiCNFfqZFu8ScwKBjoai2DKVbr8oL3VZhaCNYu5KnPmU6yCN1Vco_tHsz7at7IM0MO-ISg&amp;_gl=1&#x2A;134ip2w&#x2A;_gcl_au&#x2A;NjE4Nzg1MjA3LjE3ODc3OTAzODk.&#x2A;_ga&#x2A;MTgwODU0NDk0Ny4xNzc5ODU4OTE0&#x2A;_ga_V7ZK73W7N0&#x2A;czE3ODc3OTAzOTAkbzE0NSRnMSR0MTc4Nzc5Njk0NCRqNjAkbDAkaDA.\\">Benzinga Pro</a>. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>For the third quarter, Nvidia guided to <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61452739/nvidia-revenue-18x-growth-4-years-analyst-history\\">$108 billion in revenue</a>, topping the $103.52 billion analyst estimate. </p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Price Action:</strong> Nvidia shares closed 1.59% lower on Wednesday at $209.66 and climbed 7.3% in early pre-market trading on Thursday to $225.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Benzinga edge rankings</strong> indicate <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">Nvidia’s stock </a>has a Momentum score in the 50th percentile and a Growth score in the 99th percentile.<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noreferrer noopener\\"></a></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"1024\\" height=\\"182\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27035941/Capture-64-1024x182.png\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-1620356\\" style=\\"width:906px;height:auto\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27035941/Capture-64-1024x182.png 1024w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27035941/Capture-64-300x53.png 300w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27035941/Capture-64-768x136.png 768w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27035941/Capture-64.png 1177w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\\" /></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/analyst-stock-ratings/price-target/26/08/61453810/top-wall-street-forecasters-revamp-hormel-foods-expectations-ahead-of-q3-earnings\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nTop Wall Street Forecasters Revamp Hormel Foods Expectations Ahead Of Q3 Earnings</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer</em>:</strong><em>&nbsp;This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors</em>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo courtesy: Shutterstock</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T09:51:56Z", "headline": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Jokes His Dinner Plans Can Double a Stock—His Track Record Says He’s Not Wrong", "id": 61454688, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang has learned that a single sentence from him can move billions in market value.", "symbols": ["IGV", "IONQ", "MRVL", "NVDA", "QBTS", "RGTI"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T09:51:56Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61454688/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-jokes-his-dinner-plans-can-double-a-stock-his-track-record-says-hes-not-wrong"}'::jsonb, '753afadb541e997812ef525008c1c193d0089e48aafabcbeb6daa6ad1217158a', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61454688/ae9dcfd9fb28.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.617685+00:00'::timestamptz
