SELECT (SELECT r.revision_id FROM document_revision r JOIN document d ON d.document_id = r.document_id WHERE d.provider_id = (SELECT provider_id FROM provider WHERE code = 'alpaca') AND d.source_namespace = 'news' AND d.source_record_id = '61457781' AND NOT d.is_sample AND r.source_snapshot_hash = '1649ddd6a2a7617a7cfd5febda065580a993da9bd8bd99c74ce01ef27015b347' AND r.preprocessing_version = 'ingest-1'),  E'{"author": "Rishabh Mishra", "content": "<p><strong>Nvidia Corp.</strong> <a class=\\"ticker-link\\" data-ticker=\\"NVDA\\" data-exchange=\\"NASDAQ\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">(NASDAQ:<a class=\\"ticker\\" href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\">NVDA</a>)</a> leadership pushed back against criticism that its investments and financing arrangements could create a circular flow of capital that artificially boosts demand for its chips, during the company&#8217;s <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61449332/nvidia-q2-highlights-double-beat-huang-says-ai-infrastructure-buildout-is-at-full-steam\\">second-quarter earnings call</a> on Wednesday.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>The Circular Financing Debate</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>As skepticism mounts over Nvidia&#8217;s massive <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/08/61256057/nvidia-openai-deal-circular-financing\\">$500 billion institutional credit</a> financing push in partnership with six financial institutions and its support for a multibillion-dollar OpenAI data center in Ohio, CEO <strong>Jensen Huang</strong> and CFO <strong>Colette Kress</strong> fiercely defended the company&#8217;s balance sheet strategy.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Addressing the controversy directly, the company downplayed the fears by emphasizing that the arrangements secure infrastructure supply rather than finance demand.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Kress acknowledged the market&#8217;s unease but remained resolute: &#8220;We recognize the scale of this support, and we know some will call this circular financing. We see it differently.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang had already pushed back on the criticism earlier this month, writing in an Nvidia blog post about the Ohio project: \\"Is this circular financing? No. OpenAI will pay the lease.\\"</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/07/60713664/nvidia-funds-ai-frenzy-timeline-of-its-circular-financing-deals-so-far\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia Funds AI Frenzy: Timeline of its Circular Financing Deals &#8230; So Far</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Management Rejects &#8216;Wall Street Stunt&#8217; Claims</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Huang and Kress argue that <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61452739/nvidia-revenue-18x-growth-4-years-analyst-history\\">Nvidia is simply</a> turning compute into an investable asset class.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>&#8220;In the AI economy, compute is revenue,&#8221; Huang added, framing the deals as necessary support for frontier AI labs that are &#8220;growing faster than their balance sheets and long-term credit profiles can support.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>Bears Warn of &#8216;Biblical&#8217; Risks Amid Record Earnings</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Despite Nvidia posting record second-quarter revenue of $96.2 billion—up 106% year-over-year—critics remain unconvinced. &#8220;Big Short&#8221; investor <strong>Michael Burry</strong> has been a vocal opponent, previously <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61135655/michael-burry-calls-nvidias-500-billion-ai-financing-push-a-wall-street-stunt-meet-the-new-boss\\">slamming the financing</a> mechanisms as a &#8220;Wall Street stunt.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Highlighting a surge in Nvidia&#8217;s credit default swaps, Burry <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/07/60749765/michael-burry-warns-nvidias-overreaching-is-pushing-circular-spending-to-biblical-proportions-amid-surge-in-credit-default-swaps\\">warned that Nvidia&#8217;s &#8220;overreaching&#8221;</a> is pushing &#8220;circular spending to biblical proportions,&#8221; quipping about the OpenAI guarantee, &#8220;Around and around we go.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>Following the second-quarter report, Burry <a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/08/61454001/michael-burry-says-nvda-stock-appears-wildly-undervalued-on-paper-after-blowout-q2-earnings-but-warns-nvidia-shares-are-still-treading-water\\">doubled down on the stock&#8217;s stagnation</a>, noting that while NVDA appears &#8220;wildly undervalued&#8221; on paper with a low P/E, the share price is simply &#8220;treading water&#8221; and remains &#8220;not congruent with the market’s narrative.&#8221;</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>While Wall Street strategists debate whether this represents a dangerous bubble or a brilliant infrastructure masterstroke, Nvidia stands firm on its aggressive capital deployment as it guides for $108 billion in third-quarter revenue.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<h2 class=\\"wp-block-heading\\"><strong>How Has Nvidia Performed in 2026?</strong></h2>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p>NVDA shares rose 12.42% year-to-date, advanced by 15.34% over the last year, and gained 13.40% over the last six months. It closed 1.59% lower at $209.66 per share on Wednesday, and it was 5.91% higher in premarket trading on Thursday.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><strong>Benzinga’s Edge Stock Rankings</strong> indicate that NVDA maintains a strong price trend in the short and medium terms and a weak trend in the long term, with a solid growth score.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\\"><a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/quote/NVDA\\"><img loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"766\\" height=\\"112\\" src=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27051747/NVDA-EDGE-AUG-27-1-1.png\\" alt=\\"Benzinga’s Edge Stock Rankings for NVDA.\\" class=\\"wp-image-1620509\\" style=\\"width:920px;height:auto\\" srcset=\\"https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27051747/NVDA-EDGE-AUG-27-1-1.png 766w, https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27051747/NVDA-EDGE-AUG-27-1-1-300x44.png 300w\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 766px) 100vw, 766px\\" /></a></figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\"bz-read-next-block\\"\\n     data-variant=\\"card\\"\\n     data-news-mode=\\"manual\\"\\n\\n    >\\n\\n\\n<p>\\n<strong>\\nRead Also:\\n<a href=\\"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/08/61453544/nvidia-jensen-huang-openai-jalapeno-chip-competition\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">\\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang Not Taking OpenAI&#039;s &#039;Jalapeño&#039; Chip Personally: &#039;Lots of Projects Get Started. Lots of Projects Get Canceled&#039;</a>\\n</strong>\\n</p>\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Disclaimer:</em></strong><em> This content was partially produced with the help of AI tools and was reviewed and published by Benzinga editors.</em></p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p><em>Photo courtesy: Shutterstock</em></p>", "created_at": "2026-08-27T11:49:19Z", "headline": "NVDA Downplays ''Circular Financing'' Concerns Days After Michael Burry Called it a Wall Street Stunt: ''We See it Differently''", "id": 61457781, "images": [{"size": "large", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/The-Modern-Nvidia-Logo-And-Company-Name-.jpg?width=2048&height=1536"}, {"size": "small", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/The-Modern-Nvidia-Logo-And-Company-Name-.jpg?width=1024&height=768"}, {"size": "thumb", "url": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/27/The-Modern-Nvidia-Logo-And-Company-Name-.jpg?width=250&height=187"}], "source": "benzinga", "summary": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang pushes back on &#39;circular financing&#39; claims surrounding its $500B AI push as Michael Burry warns of risks for NVDA.", "symbols": ["NVDA"], "updated_at": "2026-08-27T11:49:19Z", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/earnings/26/08/61457781/nvda-downplays-circular-financing-concerns-days-after-michael-burry-called-it-a-wall-street-stunt-we-see-it-differently"}'::jsonb, '26338c7df97694f4b45665de2949d472ebc9758e6fbf48725872f8e539fe02fd', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["file:/Users/zuttome/LocalDocs/Learning/College/NUS/MTech-AIS/IRS/GC1/always-ignore/architecture-book/evaluation/data/alpaca_windows/0001045810-26-000073.json", "raw/alpaca/articles/61457781/1649ddd6a2a7.json"]'::jsonb, '2026-10-19T04:46:36.662207+00:00'::timestamptz
