• For NVDA (NASDAQ:NVDA), we notice a put option sweep that happens to be bearish, is expiring today. Parties traded 200 contract(s) at a $220.00 strike. This particular put needed to be split into 11 different trades to become filled. The total cost received by the writing party (or parties) was $34.5K, with a price of $173.0 per contract. There were 36397 open contracts at this strike prior to today, and today 254371 contract(s) were bought and sold.

